# `target` here is a symlink to ~/.cargo-target (the /mnt/e 9p mount is ~200x slower for
# small-file I/O). A trailing slash matches directories only, so a symlink slips past it.
*/target
*/target/
*/crashes/
.fuzz-cache/
# Run logs live outside the repo; corpora are regenerable and large.
*/corpus/
*.log
